<!-- Migration notes (WPF -> Avalonia):
     - Root xmlns set to https://github.com/avaloniaui; removed redundant child xmlns:x declarations.
     - Style TargetType="{x:Type T}" -> Selector="T" (x:Key values preserved, BasedOn preserved).
     - Style.Triggers / ControlTemplate.Triggers -> nested <Style Selector="^..."> using pseudoclasses
       (IsMouseOver->:pointerover, IsPressed->:pressed, IsEnabled=False->:disabled,
        Thumb.IsDragging->:dragging, ScrollBar.Orientation=Horizontal->:horizontal).
     - ControlTemplate.Triggers targeting named template elements -> /template/ Element#Name selectors.
     - MultiTrigger with SourceName (IsMouseOver + IsPressed) -> :pointerover:pressed (more specific
       wins, leaving :pointerover to cover the not-pressed case).
     - Property prefixes stripped in Setters (Panel.Background->Background, Border.BorderBrush->BorderBrush,
       FrameworkElement.* -> *, Control.* -> *, UIElement.* -> *, Shape.* -> *, etc.).
     - UIElement.Visibility in Setters -> IsVisible (bool: Visible->True, Collapsed/Hidden->False).
     - TemplateBinding paths stripped of class prefixes.
     - ControlTemplate internal control tree and layout preserved. -->
